# Restoration Magic, tiered (CR 702.183a): the mode's cost is paid on top of {W}, so each mode needs its own mana. With
# the only Plains tapped for Mother of Runes the spell is not offered at all (positive control: with the Plains back it
# is). With that one Plains, Cure ({0}) pays but Cura ({1}) and Curaga ({3}{W}) each still owe their cost when the
# Plains has paid {W}: those casts are cancelled, and the same Plains then casts Cure.

